=========================================================================

This software is a landing-tier shim that terminates per-class object
delivery lanes (transactions, subtrees, blocks) in front of a Teranode
cluster, hands each object class to the cluster service that owns it, and
publishes cluster-produced subtrees and blocks back onto the object plane.
Subtrees and blocks are cached and announced to the cluster with a
retrieval URL served by this software, so that pushed bytes reach the
cluster through its ordinary announce-fetch-validate path. The Teranode
cluster itself is not modified: no patched ingest, no additional RPC, and
no change to validation.

