Interoperability

This software interoperates with Teranode over its published network
interfaces only — a propagation HTTP endpoint, Kafka announcement topics,
an asset HTTP API, and a blockchain notification stream. It does not
incorporate, link, or redistribute any Teranode source code. The two
message contracts it needs are reproduced from their wire definitions:

  Teranode
  https://github.com/bsv-blockchain/teranode

